error: `this.out[0..1]` looks at `this.out`, which this call adds to
  `this.out` may move to a larger block while it grows, and `this.out[0..1]` would be read from the old one
  --> error_add_all_own_field.sg:7:25
 7 |         this.out.addAll(this.out[0..1])
   |                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  hint: add the items one by one: `this.out.add(this.out[i])` copies each before the list grows
